    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4J Studios, the team that brought Minecraft to consoles and created some of its most memorable minigames and content packs, invites you to step into the world of Reforj. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Build, and Survive</strong> in this open-world sandbox. Journey to exotic new worlds, establish settlements in hostile conditions and unlock the secrets of a lost civilization that spans multiple worlds. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated voxel worlds filled with exotic creatures and strange new elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/870810a6c6f4a4ca9f8400f7c4233a86.poster.avif?t=1745962400\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/870810a6c6f4a4ca9f8400f7c4233a86.webm?t=1745962400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCULPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform blocks into different shapes using intuitive tools for unprecedented creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/efe3a7ee3319b344e06dc2e679cd1992.poster.avif?t=1745962400\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/efe3a7ee3319b344e06dc2e679cd1992.webm?t=1745962400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in ever-changing environments where danger lurks around every corner. Delve into caves for greater resources but watch out, the further down you go the more unexpected surprises you might encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a dynamic world that changes every playthrough.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4J Studios, the team that brought Minecraft to consoles and created some of its most memorable minigames and content packs, invites you to step into the world of Reforj. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Build, and Survive</strong> in this open-world sandbox. Journey to exotic new worlds, establish settlements in hostile conditions and unlock the secrets of a lost civilization that spans multiple worlds. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated voxel worlds filled with exotic creatures and strange new elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/870810a6c6f4a4ca9f8400f7c4233a86.poster.avif?t=1745962400\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/870810a6c6f4a4ca9f8400f7c4233a86.webm?t=1745962400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCULPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform blocks into different shapes using intuitive tools for unprecedented creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/efe3a7ee3319b344e06dc2e679cd1992.poster.avif?t=1745962400\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202730/extras/efe3a7ee3319b344e06dc2e679cd1992.webm?t=1745962400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in ever-changing environments where danger lurks around every corner. Delve into caves for greater resources but watch out, the further down you go the more unexpected surprises you might encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a dynamic world that changes every playthrough.</p>",
